        "trs": "Always when we will be begun to do things, when we will be caused to ???, when we will be dirtied for someone, then you are heard, before you (so as not to) and also commit sins and also always he/she will be gotten out from bed, we will come out from (our) homes, look, (we) will go to the church, look, (we) will eat, and you will also sleep!",
